<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Ipako year net $92.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Ipako year net $92.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months ended Jun 30</p>
<p>Net $92.1 million vs n/a</p>
<p>Net assets $224.2 million vs n/a</p>
<p>Note: Q4 unavailable. Full name is Industrias Petroquimicas Argentinas Sociedad Anonima. The firm, which did not provide earnings per share, said the results included an extraordinary profit of $80.4 million.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0655</p>
